        "TileImage": "$($repository 651ceb9a-117f-4f8d-89dd-9b6bd2a38b5a).Image",
        "Description": "死を偽装しICAを抜け出した職員が見つかった\r彼女を事故死を装い暗殺してきてほしい\rなお現地に別件の標的もいるのであわせて排除してくれ\r暗殺方法の詳細は指示書を確認すること\r\rAn employee was found who faked her death and escape ICA.\rI want you to go assassinate her by faking an accident.\rThere are also other targets in the area, so eliminate them as well.\rSee instructions for details on assassination methods.",
